      Part3: 1044178613
      Part4: 3856130624
    tag: 
  - dialogueText: You know how this works mate, are you really that bad of a spy
      you can't even solve one riddle? Well riddle me this, who would wanna keep
      you around if you keep failing?
    characterEmotion: 0
    characterReaction: 0
    doesItProveAnything: 0
    isKey: 0
